Belfry
A bare stone room under the bell.  A rope hangs from it, beside a rusty lever.

>look
Belfry
A bare stone room under the bell.  A rope hangs from it, beside a rusty lever.

>ring bell
BONG.  The note rolls out over the town.

>x bell
A great bronze bell, still humming.

>ring rope
BONG.  The note rolls out over the town.

>pull rope
BONG.  The note rolls out over the town.

>ring rag
The oily rag is not something you can ring.

>ring
What do you want to ring?

>sing
Your voice echoes round the stone walls.

>pull lever
The lever is rusted solid.

>clean lever
(with the oily rag)
The rust comes away on the rag.

>clean lever with rag
The lever is already quite clean enough.

>x lever
An iron lever, bright and clean.

>pull lever
A trapdoor opens in the floor, and the game is done.

